<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Alago Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Oroma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Okpa ko Obulus da Ase ko Oroma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ase ko Oroma.</para>
  <para style="toc3">Orm</para>
  <para style="mt2">Okpa ko Obulus da</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ase ko Oroma</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Oleho mani bwebe ko Obulus, oyole ko Oyesu Okristi ase ni ayogwu wo oyole kweyi yo tagye gogo do oshu neshi ko Owuso ni. <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Oshu neshi ni osho okoyi nu gbeji-gbeji bwebe ko Owuso bwabo kawo bane nu ipu ko Okpa ko Owuso. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Ikweyi ko Oyi nu ni ipu kikpiye Obwi ipwoma ko ose Odawuda; <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />kweyi bwebe ko Omaku sere adanoshu ko wo Oyi ko Owuso bwebe ko yiso ko Oyesu bwamiri. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Bwebe nu kpa abishi kiye nu, apyeshi ko Owuso kpoko kayikoko ko Oyesu ko yase ogwu bwipu kawase ni wase ko yahuda lo ni kpiri gipu kogeyagye ni ya wa bwipu kotuse ni. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Omani kala ni bo Oroma ni, Kweyi ayala ogwu ko wa ko Oyesu Okristi mamani.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Mani oni nta dala ayene hin moshi kpiri ni bo Oroma ni Owuso yimu kala kweyi yala ogwu wase sere ni:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Oneshi kpo omene bwebe ko Owuso Ada kpa Adole Oyesu Okristi.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inarigwu Kotu Kyokye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Ikyikyo nyya shotunehe do Owuso bwebe ko Oyesu Okristi ela kala kpiri, ikweyi koni oshu kotuse kala ge ebebenya ipu kese mani. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Owuso ni nyya geyagye danu kpotu oye kponu ebe ko tono ko oshu neshi ko Oyi nu ni, pini wolobene hin mo nyya rela kala ishi kpiri <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />ipu kinarigwu tota hin ishi kpiri; kweyi nyya tinarigwu do Owuso mo anani ogwejeji owe na gwa dami shini na webe kala. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Nyyimu ko mala shini na dala eshi ko omaku ko yala loshu. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Shini ami kpala an tiyika otugbagba bwebe kotuse kiyika.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Nyya yimu shini ala gye, ayene hin, mo ngbo ishi nwashika ko webe kala Apa shunbita lo, anani ome npyowe ma. Ko wa kyizire ebe kala, byoni nkye ipu kawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni.<verse eid="ROM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Ngboko ebe kawo Ogirik kpa awase ni wo Ogirik lo ni, kawoziyi kawikyo.<verse eid="ROM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Ozani ya ni ngbimu ko tono ko oshu neshi gebe kala ni bo Oroma ni mamani oma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oshu kela ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Nyya yiweyi ko oshu neshi mani lo, ikweyi koni owoshu ko Owuso la ko ngmase kpiri ni kyogwu kpanu ni; do Oyahuda ikyikyo, ome awase ko yahuda lo. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Koni ipu ko oshu neshi ayoza neshi ni bwebe ko Owuso ni gwa tese, oza neshi ni bwebe kotuse bwikyikyo gogwejeji ni. Byoni ayitota mo, &lt;&lt;Aseneshi ya yagye kpotuse la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oza labi ka Asuse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Anya ko Owuso sa bwi iso ikweyi kasuse ni ba gboso Owuso lo ni kpo ozalabi ka asuse ni ba yo kwokwoshi gwu kpo ozalabi wa ni. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Koni agyoza ni ashu ko gye ikweyi ko Owuso ni, ikweyi koni Owuso abiyinu yi gwa dawa ni. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Bwo kwagye kese mani oshi ko Owuso ni iyi kasuse ya ma lo ni, oshu nu ko gbogbo-gbogbo kpo oyi nu ko Owuso akwobonu ma bwebe ko oza ni oya ni, shini asuse naka gbo nyepwo ko ojije lo. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Koni agyo Owuso ni, atela ko danu abokpa ko Owuso, ake shotunehe danu lo, omoma ko otuwa ke woyeye kweyi otu wa ni wikyo ni dibu. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Aba kamo awa ziyi, ake wikyo la <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />kweyi atela ko geyagye do Owuso ni ya gekwu lo ni dawoyi ni, ageyagye dawoza ni ayuwa le bya asuse kpawigbano kpawebe kikyashi kwe awebe ni ba pyipu agye ba gekwu ni.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Byoni olema oni, Owuso shuwabita ipu kimu ko ozalabi ni yotu wa ko yoya, kweyi ayoza kiweyi koyi ikpiye yishi kpiyiwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Ayokwokwoshi ko Owuso pya wokame; kweyi ki ba geyagye dawoza ni Owuso ya ni sho Owuso ni yuwa ni abi nu, niye shosha kpiri wakakanu ko gbogbo-gbogbo ni! Nalemani.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Ikweyi koni, Owuso shuwa bita ipu ko mehe kozalabi ni ya tuwiweyi ni. Anya wa yoza ni Owuso ya ni pya bwebe ko gbotagye kpanya byawa. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Mamani ango yoza ni Owuso ya ni pya bwebe ko mehe kango byawa. Ango ba gbotagye kpango byawa, kweyi apyabola kozalabi wa.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Ikweyi koni, ama moshoshi ko gyo Owuso lo, Owuso shuwa bita kpo otulabi, ko yoza ni ashu ko ya lo ni. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Anwonwu kpedo ko otulabi wonyonya, ozabibi, imu kiyiwa, kpa anya yoya. Anwonwu kpa anya kiyiwa, ba ngmiyiwa, ba gbapwo, ba gyiyiwa egya, ba fokwunu kpiyiwa. Aba lokwunu agye, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />Ba yiyiwa ishi, awo tela ko Owuso, awino mesa ka asuse, awo lagbiti kpo zikweyi iso, Awoyowe ko yozalabi, awo gyagye kpase ni muwa ni; <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Awikyo, awogbotuse lo, awoyonotu, awo gbiyinyinyi lo. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Koni agyono neshi ko Owuso ni kamo awo yawoza mani kpiri shi ikwu goga ni, agohobu ko ya mani kin lalo, apa gwagye tawino yoya otu.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Epwo ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Ala awoya hin ke bwowe ko nyepwo lo, ala ni ba kwase ashishini epwo ni, ishi kpiri ni oya kwashe epwo, oya kwiyo epwo oma, ikweyi koni ala ni ba kuwepwo ni ba ya mamani. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Kweyi agye mo epwo ko Owuso wokwokwoshi ikweyi kawo yoza mani. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Ala awoya hin, owoni awo asuse ya kwase epwo, ome, awo kiya mamani byawa ni, omamo oya gege ya bose abo ko Owuso eno kepwo koka? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Oya keshi ko Owuso ikweyi kiyinyinyi, kpo otuzoze ni ogbo ome oya dawo ishi ko shagbotu ni.<verse eid="ROM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Ikweyi ko zakpaha ni ala gbo kpo ozalabi ome ni ala ki ta ko shagbotu do Owuso ni, ala ba kpanya ko Owuso tukpa gbeyi ke eno kepwo ko Owuso ni yawa ni. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Owuso Yawa dananoho abola koza ni oyaya ni. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Awase ni hagye loshu ko yoza neshi ba labo kigyashi kpa abokpa kpoyiyi ko gbogbo-gbogbo; oya dawo Olayi ko gbogbo-gbogbo. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Awase ni ke ba yimu kiyiwa kpawo tela ko kwokwoshi ga gboso obibi; Anya ko Owuso yikweyi wa. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Owe kpo otubyobya yaba dawino yoza labi, kikyikyo Oyahuda ome awase ni wo Oyahuda lo. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Owuso ke ya dawa igyashi, kpo abokpa, omene wa kase kpiri ni ya yoza neshi ni, kikyikyo Oyahuda ome awase ni ke wo yahuda lo. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Owuso ya yimu kashe shashe lo.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Kpiri kase ni ba yozalabi gogo kpono ko Omusa ni; ba gekwu gogo kpono, kweyi kpiri kase ni yozalabi ipu ko ono ono ya kuwepwo. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Koni ase ni pwono ni pini ba wase neshi obutu ko Owuso lalo, ase ni ke ba gboso ono ni pini ba waseneshi la. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Ko kwokwoshi owoni awase ko Oyahuda lo ni gbono lo ni; ke ba yoza ni ono ka ni, awono kabiyiwa oma, koni agbono abo wa lo ni, <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />koni asayi kamo ayoza ni ono kani tota ipu kotu wa ni, otu wa yolobene, ome elakotu wa ya kuwepwo, anani oki ya shepwo wa. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Oza mani wa gbodagye eno ni Owuso kepwo koza-teba kananoho bwebe ko Oyesu Okristi, byoni oshu neshi hin ka ni.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ase ko Oyahuda Kpo Ono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Anani, owoni ala ba yiyi kala ogu mase ko Oyahuda; owoni ala yotu sono kweyi ba gwabotu kpema kala kpo Owuso; <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />Owoni ala gyoza ni Owuso ya yimu shala ya, kweyi ala gyoneshi kpolabi byoni ono fala ni; <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />owoni ala kyogwu mala wawino pyofiyi abo, ala woyoyu dase ni bebe dibu ni, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />ki wino dikyo ela, ino fayileke oza, koni ala gboko kozagyogye kpo kwokwoshi ipu ko ono ni. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Ala ni ba fase oza ni ala yamoji ba fiyi kala lo? Ala ni ba tono, ba wobi kowiyi ni, ala ke ba wiyi abiyikala? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Ala ni ba wasobi kamo, &lt;&lt;ala ka beba lo&gt;&gt; ni, ala ki ba beba? Ala ni ba wobi keka yoya ni, ala ki ba wiyi kiyo kofonu keka? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Ala ni ba yo wada kpono ni, ala to Owuso nye bwebe ko ono ni ala yi kigbo ni lo? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Byoni okpa kamo, &lt;&lt;Ase ni wase ko yahuda lo ni ba yo Owuso ishi ikweyi kala ni wase ko yahuda ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Ofu shoshe gboko owoni ala ba gboso ono neneshi, owoni ala ke yono kyigbo, ala lema gyogye byofu afafu oma. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Owoni agboga, awase ni ashuwofu lo ni, yoza gyogye byoni ono kani, Owuso azuwa lema gyogye kpa wase ni shofu ni lo? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Ase ni ashofu kikpiye lo oke ya gboso ono neneshi, azawo ni shofu ni wase yeye, koni ogbono ome okyi shofu ni, owino yono kigbo.<verse eid="ROM 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Ase ya gege ya wase ko Oyahuda lo owoni oyipu ki kpiye, ofu shoshe ke wa kikpiye kpo kya kin la lo. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Aayi, ase ya wase ko Oyahuda owoni owa kipu-ipu la; kweyi ofu shoshe wofu shoshe kipu kotu la, bwebe ko Omaku, obwebe ko ono lalo. Iyeshosha kedo kasuse mani bwebe kasuse la lo, opa bwebe ko Owuso la.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Oji wo neshi ko wase ko Oyahuda ikweyi kawase ni wo Oyahuda lo? Kwe oji woshi ko ofu shoshe? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Oshoshi nwashika ipu ko joji! Kikyikyo awo yahuda, awa pini ayela ko Owuso dawa abo ikyikyo la.<verse eid="ROM 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Oji yu wa owoni ashini wa gbotuse lo? Otuse ni agbo lo ni ya gege ya wobi ko gbotuse ko Owuso? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Aayi! Kase kpiri na wawino kame, Owuso wokwokwoshi la. Byoni ayitota ipu ko kpa ko Owuso ni mo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">&lt;&lt;Shini owase tata ipu kela koka wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">oki bose shepwo ishi ke epwo koka wo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Owoni okwokwoshi ni agbo lo ni byo kwokwoshi ko Owuso wese ododa, aba kamoji? Kwe aha kiba kamo Owuso yoza neshi lo koni oya kyanya kpaha ni la? (Nyya kela bwebe komoma ka asuse.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Olema lalo! Owoni obi lemani, Owuso bi ya kepwo kese mani moji? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Oye yaba ashe ya tawashu mo, Owoni okame hin yokwokwoshi ko Owuso gohobu kweyi danu igyashi, ojiya ome, ni aba zun winozalabi kwikyikyeni? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Koni olemani &lt;&lt;ojiya wahobi ko gohobu kpo ozalabi shini oza neshi nawa&gt;&gt;? Byoni ase shishini ba maha ka ni! Awino kela mani shu ko yishi.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ashishe Wase Neshi Lo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Aba ngmeyi kela mani moji? Aha shoshi shase shishini la? Aayi! Ka aha ase ko Oyahuda kase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni kpiri ka aha bwowe ko ozalabi. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Byoni okpa ko Owuso kani:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">&lt;&lt;Ashishe waseneshi lo,<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Ashishe ziyi lo kwe ashishe tikpo ko Owuso lo.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Ananoho pyitikpi to Owuso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">kpiri ka asuse nyowe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">ashe kponu yoza neshi lo.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Okwunu wa gwogwa byamiri ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">igbenu wa ba fokame kin la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Akpokunu wa gbefa ke egwa nyakwu;<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Okwunu wa nwonwu kpesa sosa lono-lono.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Ikpo wa gbiyawu papa ko ga ngmase kpo dawowe;<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Ishi kpowe ba gbosuwa ebe ni aga kpiri.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Kweyi agyowe ko omene lo,<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Agboshi ko Owuso otuwa lo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Byoni abani oza ni ono ka kpiri, oya ka dawase ni ba gboso ono ni la, shini okunu kananoho na gwu kweyi ese mani gbepwo obutu ko Owuso. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Byoni olemani oni ashe kponu ya wase neshi ebe nu bwebe ko ko ono lo; pa, bwebe ko ono pini agyela ko ozalabi la.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oweni Owuso Yase Woneshi kpanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Byonabani ke oneshi bwebe ko Owuso, ni gbela ko ono lo ni, ayigwa wa, byoni ono ko Omusa kpawobane kani. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Oneshi ni bwebe ko Owuso ni wa bwebe ko totuso Oyesu Okristi dase kpiri ni totuso ni. Ogogo lo kpiri-kpiri: <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Koni ase kpiri yozalabi kweyi nye ebe kigyashi ko Owuso. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Kweyi ayaha wase neshi yeye bwebe keshi ko Owuso ni apye bwebe ko Okristi Oyesu ni ngmaha ni. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Owuso daho Oyesu Okristi na weshi popa ko sore kozalabi, bwebe ko totuso oyi nu. Oya mani ko shaha okwokwoshi nu. Ipu kotumene nu ozotu kpozalabi ni ase ba ya ga ni, <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />anani ke, Owuso ya hagye ikweyi kokwokwoshi nu ko yase kpiri ni kyogwu kpo Oyesu na wase neshi.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Oji wakya gwogwa wo? Oyaba kelo. Oji ni aba ya shini ahan sho Owuso otu? Aba gboso ono la? Aayi, bwebe kotuse la. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Koni aha kyogwu mo ayaha wase neshi bwebe kotuse la, gbela ko gboso ono lo. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Owuso wo Owuso kase ko Oyahuda kin la? Owuso kase ni Oyahuda lo ni mamani la lo? Owa kakawa mamani la. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Owuso woye kponu la, anu ni yase ni shofu kpase ni shofu lo ni wase neshi bwebe kotuse wani. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Aha sho ono bita ikweyi kotuse mani ona? Aayi! Kwikyikyeni aha byo ono.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Otuse ki Ibirayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Oji ni aha ba ka mo osoku kaha ki Ibirayi gye ikweyi kela mani? Oji wo gyogye nu? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Owoni ayi Ibirayi wase neshi bwebe koko nu, ogbowada ko yoya, oni oke wa ko Owuso la lo. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Okpa ko Owuso kamo oji? &lt;&lt;Ibirayi totuso Owuso azo wino yoza neshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Nabani owoni ase yoko, abola nu weshi lalo, owotiri ko danu la. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Mani oni, ase ni ke yoko lo, opa yotuso Owuso ni ya yase ya wase neshi ni, otuse nu wokwunu koza neshi danu oma. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Odawuda ka mamani ishini okela ikweyi kaboneshi kase ni Owuso yo wase neshi bwebe koko lalo ni:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />&lt;&lt;Otunehe wa kase ni ayozalabi nu na ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">ase ni Owuso yozalabi nu gbo ni.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Otunehe wa kase ni Owuso ya yarisawu ko ozalabi nu lo ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Otunehe mani no Odawuda ka wa kawo ni shofu kin la, kwe kase ni shofu lo ni? Aayi! Aba kamo okpa ko Owuso kamo azotuse ki Ibirayi woza neshi danu. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Ishinya ni oza mani gbodagye? Olema danu ome Oshofu la kwe, ishini oshofu walo ni? Ogbodagye ome Ibirayi shofu la. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ofu shoshe ki Ibirayi woyi ko neshi ni opye bwebe kotuse bwishini oshofu wa lo ni. Mani oni Ibirayi wada kase kpiri ni gbotuse kweyi ake shuwofu lo ni, shini ana yuwa wase neshi. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Anu ki wada kawo shofu kin lalo, awase ni shofu kweyi ki ba koyi kikpo kotuse ni ada ka Ibirayi ye ome oshofu ni.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okoyi ko Owuso Na ze Bwebe Kotuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Bwebe ko ono pini Ibirayi kpayi kipwoma nu zokoyi ko rogwu kese mani la lo, pa bwebe koza neshi ni bwebe kotuse ni la. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Owoni awino ko ono bi wawo orogwu, otuse bi ya woyeye kweyi okoyi bi ya gbojije lo, <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />ikweyi koni ono byanya ko Owuso wa. Ebeni ono yaba lo epwo yaba lo.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Byoni olemani oni, okoyi ko Owuso wa bwebe kotuse, shini ona weshi dipwoma ki Ibirayi kpiri, wa kawine ko ono kin lalo, ke kawine kotuse ki Ibirayi. Owada kaha kpiri. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Byoni okpa ko Owuso kani, &lt;&lt;Ami yo wada kase lewa.&gt;&gt; Owada ka ebe ko Owuso ni ototuso ni, Owuso ni zolayi dawase ni gekwu ni kweyi oki yawoza ni baba lo ni ogwu byababa ni.<verse eid="ROM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ishini Owuso shokoyi di Ibirayi moya wada kase lewa ni, Ibirayi totu so. Owuso ki kamo ipwoma wo ya lewa byinyiwo ni,&gt;&gt; Okoyi oni lema byoya gbodagye lo ni <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Otuse ki Ibirayi shakwini lo, kosawukye kikpiye ni tanu byoni ashayi nu shini gbayayi ko gyo ogbogbo ome onya nu Osera wo odoma ni. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Koni olema danu ni, otuse nu shakwini ikweyi kokoyi ni Owuso ya ni lo; opa hagye loshu otuse nu, oki sho Owuso iye. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Oyotu nu se do Owuso mo ogboshu ko yoza ni oshokoyi ni. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Oza ni ya ni Ibirayi, bwebe kotuse &lt;&lt;pyabokpa kase neshi ebe ko Owuso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Ela ni kamo &lt;&lt;Owuso zo wase neshi,&gt;&gt; ayi tota danu fufunu lalo. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Oke wa aka kaha mamani la, dase ni Owuso ya danabokpa kase neshi ni, daha ni kyogwu kpanu ni Owuso yo Oyesu Adole kaha nyiso amiri ni. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Owuso yo dikwu ikweyi kozalabi kaha, kweyi anganu iso shini ona yaha na wase neshi kpo Owuso.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Neshi Kpo Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Byoni abani, daha ni amiyinyinyi kaha bwebe kotuse ni, aha gbotumene kpo Owuso bwebe ka Adole Oyesu Okristi, <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Bwebe nu pini aha pyeshi ni aha banu mani bwebe kotuse kaha la. Kweyi aha ba shotunehe ipu kiyitagye ki igyashi ko Owuso! <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Olema kin lalo, aha ki ba shotunehe ipu ko owe moma kaha, ikweyi koni aha gye mo owe moma ya yaha ba zotu, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />Owuso yaha zotu tahabo ko yoza neshi, kweyi oza neshi ya daha iyitagye. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Iyitagye mani ke ya gbaha owuru lo, byoni Owuso pyashu ki imu yoya nu shipu kotu kaha byinyo ki ishu ni ya pope bwebe ko Omaku Sere ko Owuso ni odaha ni.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Ala ma, ipu kishi neshi, ishini aha gboshu lo ni, Okristi gekwu ikweyi kase ni gyo Owuso lo ni. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Ashishe ya kyogwu ko gekwu ikweyi kase neshi ni, owoni ashe ya kyogwu, oya kyogwu ko gekwu ikweyi kase neshi la. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Owuso ke shiyaha imu yoya nu nwashika, bwishi ni aha tayayo bipu ko ozalabi ka aha ni, Okristi gekwu abishi kaha! <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Byoni bwebe koyi nu ayaha na sere ni, ikwu nu ngmaha shanya ko Owuso! <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Koni bwishi ni aha wawo monyekwotu ko Owuso ni, bwebe kikwu ko oyi nu ke yaha woya nu, byo nabani aha woya ko Owuso wa, oya le moji Owuso ya ngmaha ikweyi koni Okristi gbo olayi! <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Oke lema ni kin lalo, aha ki ba shotunehe ipu ko Owuso bwebe ka Adole Oyesu Okristi, anu ni yaha woya kpo Owuso ni.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adomu kpo Okristi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Byoni ozalabi wese mani bwebe ko ozalabi kase oye kponu, kweyi ikwu ki wa bwebe ko ozalabi, kweyi bwowe mani ikwu webe kananoho; koni ananoho yozalabi ni. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Ome ana byo ono wa, ozalabi ke kwobonu yese mani, Akwashishe epwo kozalabi ishi oni walo, ikweyi koni ono yaba wa lo ni. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Koni olemani oni, ikwu ya ngmase bwishi ka Adomu gishi ko Omusa, kawase ni yozalabi ko yono kigbo bya Adomu lo ni, ni wotu kase ni yawa ni. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Eshi ke lema byozalabi lalo. Owoni ase lewa gekwu ikweyi ko zalabi kase oye, Adomu, eshi ko Owuso ni gebe kase lewa bwebe kase oye, Oyesu Okristi. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Kwikyikyeni, eshi ko Owuso gogo kpo ozalabi kase oye. Ozalabi kase oye yaha, &lt;&lt;Gbepwo.&gt;&gt; Eshi ko Owuso ke yaha wase neshi ebe ko Owuso, koni ozalabi nwashika bikweyi ka aha ni, Eshi ko Owuso mani yaha, &lt;&lt;Gbepwo lo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Owoni kwokwoshi ozalabi kase oye byikwu wa bwebe kase oye, oya lemoji dawase ni pyeshi koza neshi ko Owuso ipu kolayi bwebe kase oye ni wo, Oyesu Okristi.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Byoni olemani oni, ozalabi kase oye ka Adomu byikwu wa dase kpiri, mamani abola koza neshi kase oye ko Okristi byoyagye neshi kpo Owuso wa kpo olayi dase kpiri. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Koni bwebe kase oye ni lagbiti ni ayase nwashika ya wawino yozalabi, mamani, bwebe kase oye ni geyagye ni ayase nwashika ya wase neshi.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Akwo Ono shini ananoho na mozalabi nu la; Kweyi ebeni ozalabi ke nwashika ni, oneshi ko Owuso nwashika she. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Shini byoni ozalabi yoshu ikweyi ka asuse kweyi byikwu ngmuwa ni, mani eshi ko Owuso pini ya yoshu la, oyaha wase neshi ebe ko Owuso shini an pyolayi ko gbogbo bwebe ko Oyesu Okristi Adole ka.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Gekwu Kozalabi, Yiyi ipu ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Oji ni aha ba ka? Ahan gohobu ko yozalabi shini eshi ko Owuso na nwa? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Aayi! Aha kwobonu gekwu ipu ko zalabi wa, aba yamoji ba gbolayi ipu nu ke? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Kwe ala gye mo kpiri ka aha ni ayaho obatisma gipu ko Oyesu Okristi ni ayaho obatisima gipu ki ikwu nu lalo? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Mani oni, ayaha nyi kpanu bwebe ko obatisma gipu kikwu shini, byoni Oyesu nyiso amiri bwebe ki igyashi ka Ada ni, aha ba bagye ipu ko wushoshu pepe mamani.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Owoni aha kwobo nu woye kponu kpanu mani ipu ki ikwu nu bwebe ko obatisma, aba woye kponu kpanu mamani ipu ko nyiso amiri byoni owe ni. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Koni agye mo ayikpiye kaha nekye poshi kpanu shini ahan yikpiye ko ozalabi gwotonu, shini ahan ka wo oshe ko ozalabi kelo. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Ikweyi koni ase ni gekwu, obose shabo ko ozalabi.<verse eid="ROM 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Anani owoni aha gekwu kpo Okristi, aha kyogwu maha ba biyi kpanu mamani. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Aha gye mo koni Okristi nyiso amiri ni, oya gekwu kelo, ikwu gboshu ko wadole nu kelo. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Ikwu ni oga ni, ogekwu igboye kponu ko yoshu ko ozalabi kyigbo. Owushoshu nu nabani ke wa ko Owuso. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Mamani, ziyo wo kwu ipu ko ozalabi, byoni ozalabi we ni, kweyi oke yiyi do Owuso bwebe ko Okristi Oyesu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Mani oni, ka yozalabi na zoshu kikpiye wo shini ogeyagye dimu bibi nu lo.<verse eid="ROM 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Ala ka zawigo kikpiye kala dozalabi ko wiyo koko ko ozabibi lo, ala ke ziyikala do Owuso, koni ala gekwu anani ala ke gbolayi pepe. Mani oni, ala yoko kpikpiye kala kpiri na wiyo koko ko oza neshi do Owuso. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Ka zozalabi na wa adole kala lo, ikweyi koni ono yikweyi kala kelo, oneshi ko Owuso pini yikweyi kala la.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awoshe Koza Neshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Oya lemoji? Ahan yozalabi koni ono yikweyi kaha kelo, koni oneshi yaba ni? Aayi!<verse eid="ROM 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Ala gye mo owoni ala ziyikala dashe ko gbeshe danu, ala wo oshe kase ni ala ba geyagye danu ni lalo Kala wo oshe ko ozalabi, ni ya byikwu wa ni, kwe ala wa ko geyagye, ni ya byoza neshi ko Owuso wa ni? <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Otunehe ke wa ko Owuso! Koni ala wawo oshe ko ozalabi ga ni, ala zoza ni afala mani kpotu oye kponu. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Anani angmala shozalabi kweyi ala wawo oshe ko oza neshi ni Owuso yayimu.<verse eid="ROM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />(Nkela mani byoni asuse ba ka ni, ikweyi koni ala loshu ikpiye lo ni. Byoni ala ba zikpiye kala ba gbeshe) doza kebi kpozabibi ni yipu kogye ni, anani ala zikpiye kala ko gbeshe doza neshi ko Owuso, ni ya yala wase sere ni. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Ishini ala wawo oshe kozalabi ni, oza neshi gboshu ikweyi kala lo. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Oji ni ala pye ishi oni bwebe kawoza ni ala ba yiweyi wa nabani ni? Awoza ni ba byikwu wa ni!<verse eid="ROM 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Anani ake ngmala shozalabi kweyi wawo oshe ko Owuso, oza ni ala pye ni yala wase sere, kweyi okweyi nu wo Olayi ko gbogbo. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Koni abola kozalabi wikwu, eshi ko Owuso ke wo Olayi ko gbogbo ipu ko Okristi Oyesu Adole ka.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Ozafofu Konya kpo Oba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Ala gye lo, ayene Nyya kela kpase ni gyono ni ala gye mono yikweyi kasuse ishini oya gbo layi ni kin. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Byoni owe ni onya gboba, ono yo gbo bobunu kishini obunu yiyi ni la, owoni obunu ke gekwu, ono koyagye konya kpoba yikweyi nu kelo. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Owoni ogboba oye hoha ishini obunu tayayo yiyi ni, aba yo mo agbaza. Owoni obunu ke gekwu, ono oni yikweyi nu kelo kweyi owagbaza lo, koni ogboba oye hoha ni.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Ayene hin, mamani ala gekwu depwo bwipu kikpiye bwipu ki kpiye ko Okristi, anani ala bipu kanu ni nyiso ikwu ni koni ahawase koyoko ko Owuso ni. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Owoni imu kikpiye kpala ogwu, Imu ko yozalabi ya yoko ipu kikpiye ka, kweyi gwejeji koza yoya wikwu la <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Anani ke, agekwu kpo ono niya gbaha ni, ashaha bita ipu ko ono shini angeyagye dowe ko Omaku ni wowe nekye na yi ta lo ni.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ono kpo zalabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Kwaha akamo ono abwiyinu woza labi? Kwokwoshi, olema lalo! Oke wono pi yun gyo zani ozalabi weni. Owoni ono ka mani lo, Ka gbimu koza ni wa kashe ni lo, nbiya gege ko gyedo kimu mani lo. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Ozalabi ke zoshu ikweyi ko ono mani oyun gbimu kiyun. Owoni owono lalo, ozalabi wikwu. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Nekye-nekye nggyono lo; ishini ono ke wa ni, ozalabi wa gbolayi kweyi ami gekwu, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />nwwa ma kamo ono ni shu ko byolayi wa ni, byikwu wa ko kwokwoshi. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Ozalabi pyebe, gyumegya bwebe ko ono kweyi yun ngmo <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Bwebe ni ono kokpagye yo sere, ono ko Owuso yo sere, oke gyogye kpo neshi. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Ozani shoshi ni byikwu wa ngmun ona? Ole mani lalo! Ozalabi piya la; bwebe ko yoneshi, ozalabi byikwu wa dami, bwebe ko ono ko Owuso ozalabi na wolabi kwokwoshi<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apwo Ipu ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Agye mani! Ono yipu komaku, amike yipu kikpiye, nwwase ni ayora wo oshe do zalabi. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Ngyoza ni nyya ya ni lo; ikweyi koni nyya yoza ni nyya yimu ko ya ni lo, npa ya yoza ni nyya yimu ko ya lo ni. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Owoni nyyoza ni nyya yimu ko ya ni lo, omani ya sayi mo nkyogwu kamo ono mani gyogye. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Ami piya yawoza mani lalo; oke wozalabi ni yikpiye ni la <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Ngye mo oza neshi ayo kpami lo Oni ipu ki kpiyen. Koni nyya yimu koneshi ni, nke gege yalo. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Nyyo neshi ni nyya yimu ko ya ni lo; kweyi npa, yobibi ni nyya yimu ko ya lo ni. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Owoni nyyo zani nyya yimu koya lo ni, omani ya kamo ami piya la lo; oke, wozalabi ni yikpiye hin ni.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Oni ngye kamo ono mani ya yoko: ishini nyya yimu ko yoza neshi, ozalabi kin pini otu hin ya ze ko yoya la. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Koni nyya shotunehe kpo ono ko Owuso bwipu kotu hin. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Nke mono oye gogo ya yoko ikpiye hin, ono ni ya nonu kpono notu hin ze ni; Oyun wase ni ayishetu do ono kozalabi niya yoko ikpiye ni. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Ngbotu byobya nwashika! Anoho ya ngmami shikpiye kikwu mani? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Nshotunehe do Owuso ni yoza mani bwebe ka Adole Oyesu Okristi!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Omani, ke, woza ni tiyun ipunu ni: kpotu hin ami ageyagye do Owuso, ikpiyen ke ya geyagye dono kozalabi.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Olayi Ipu ko Omaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Mani oni, awase ni bipu ko dudu kpo Okristi Oyesu aba kwuwepwo lo, <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />koni bwebe ko Oyesu Okristi ono ko Omaku kolayi yun ngma shono kozalabi kpikwu. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Ozani ono gboshu ko ya lo ikweyi koni ikpiye kozalabi yoshu bize ni, Owuso yi ya. Oto Oyi nu oleho wa kpikpiye bya kasuse ni ya yozalabi ni, kowa yozalabi bize. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Owuso ya mani shini oza neshi ni ono ya doka ni na gya ipu ka aha, ni bagye ipu ko Omaku ni, wipu kikpiye kozalabi lalo. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Awase ni bagye ipu kikpiye kozalabi ni yotu wa soza ni ikpiye oni ya doka ni; awase ni ke bagye ipu ko Omaku ni yotu wa soza ni Omaku ya doka ni.<verse eid="ROM 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Otu kino ozalabi wikwu, otu ni ke ya do Omaku oye ni wolayi kpomene. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Otu kozalabi womonyekwotu ko Owuso. Oya geyagye dono ko Owuso lo, oke ya gege ya geyagye danu lo. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Awino geyagye dikpiye kozalabi wa ba gege ko sho Owuso otu lo.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Ala ke bagye ipu kikpiye kozalabi lalo, ipu ko Omaku la, owoni Omaku ko Owuso yipu kala. Kweyi ase ni gbo Omaku ko Okristi lo, owa ko Okristi lalo. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Owoni Okristi ke yipu kala, ikpiye kala gekwu ikweyi kozalabi, omaku kala ke yiyi ikweyi koza neshi. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Owoni Omaku ko Owuso ni ngmo Oyesu bwikwu ni yipu kala, anu ni ngmo Okristi bwikwu ni ki ya dikpiye kala ni ya gekwu ni olayi bwebe ko Omaku nu, ni yipu kala ni.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Mani oni, ayene, aha gboko ko yoya do Owuso ipu ko olayi ka, oko mani ke wa ko yoza ni ikpiye kozalabi ya yimu ni lalo. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Owoni ala ba yoza ni ikpiye kozalabi ya yimu ni, ala ba gekwu; owoni ala ke yoko bibi kikpiye ngmo bwebe ko Omaku, ala ba gbolayi. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Ikweyi koni awase ni Omaku ko Owuso ya kpuwogwu ni wayi ko Owuso la. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Koni Omaku ni Owuso dala ni wako ki yala wawo oshe koshi yoya lalo, Omaku oni ke yala wayi ko Owuso. Kweyi bwebe koshu ko Omaku aba shogwu yo mo, &lt;&lt;Ada, Ada Ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Omaku abiyinu yolobene kpomaku ka mo awayi ko Owuso. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Anani owoni awayi, awawo rogwu oma-awawo rogwu ko Owuso dudu kpo Okristi, owoni amowe kpo Okristi, aki ba byigyashi kpanu mamani.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igyashi ni Yohobu ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Nma kamo owe moma ka kanani figyashi ni aba wa yi gwa daha ni lo. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Oza kpiri ni Owuso ya ni ba gbeyi kayi ko Owuso ni oya wa sayi wa ni. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Oko kabo ko Owuso ya megye, wimu kotu nu lalo, oke wimu kotu kase ni danegye ni, kwikyikyeni ayiyitagye <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />mo enoye aba yo Oko kabo ko Owuso abiyinu ngma shipu keshe koza ni ya kwoka ni kweyi byo wipu kigyashi kongmongma kayi ko Owuso.<verse eid="ROM 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Aha gye mo Oko kabo ko Owuso kpiri ya dose, byose koyi moma kwikyikyeni. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Anu fufunu lalo, kaha abiyika, ni gbogwogwa kikyikyo ko Omaku ni, ba dose ipu ka byoni aba gbeyi nu ko wa zaha wayi nu, kweyi ngmikpiye ka. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Koni ipu kiyitagye mani pini angmaha la. Iyitagye ni ake ba ma ni wiyitagye lalo. Anoho ya yiyitagye doza ni okwobonu gbo ni? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Owoni ake yiyitagye doza ni agbo walo ni, aba gbeyi nu kpotumene.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Mamani, Omaku ya tahabo ipu kikpiye shosha ka. Aha gyoza ni ashu ko tinarigwu ikweyi nu ni lo, Omaku abiyinu ke ya tinarigwu daha kponu ni okwunu ya gege ya ka lo ni. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Kweyi Owuso ni ya gyipu kotu ka ma ni, gyotu ko Omaku; ikweyi koni Omaku ya tinarigwu dase sere byoni Owuso ya yimu ni la.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Kweyi agye mipu kojoji Owuso ya yoko ko neshi kawase ni ba yimu nu ni, awase ni ayuwogwu bwebe kimu kotu nu ni. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Awase ni Owuso kwobonu gyuwa ni, oyuwa shagye gogo kowa le byo Oyi nu, shini ona woyikyikyo ipu kayene lewa. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Kweyi Awase ni oyuwa shagye gogo ni, oki yuwogwu, awase ni oyuwogwu ni, odawepwo neshi, awase ni odawepwo neshi ni, oki dawigyashi nu.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imu ko Owuso Ipu Okristi Oyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Oji ni aba ka ikweyi kela mani kpiri? Owoni Owuso yo kpaha, anoho ya kwagye konu kpaha? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Owuso ni wobi ko Oyi nu lo, pa yo peshi daha kpiri ni, oya gege ya yojoji kpiri manu daha kpotu oye kponu lo? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Anoho ya kwase ni Owuso shu ni epwo? Owuso abiyinu pini shepwo neshi dawa la. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Anoho ke ya kwepwo? Oyesu Okristi ni gekwu ni, ki she mani, onyiso bwikwu wolayi-oyagye abore ko Owuso kweyi ki yabore ko Owuso, yaba ikweyi ka. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Anoho ya yaha ko kpimu ko Okristi? Otubyobya la kwe owe moma kwe egyemoma kwe emye kwe ewewa kwe ebi kwe ewakpa? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Byoni okpa ko Owuso kani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">&lt;&lt;Koni awase wo ni abowe kikwu ishi kpiri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">Azaha byo otukpo ni aba ga yi shoko ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Aayi, ipu kawoza mani kpiri ashawino refu bwebe kase ni yimu ka ni! <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Koni nkyogwu kpotu oye kponu mojije ya gege ya yaha ko kpimu ko Owuso lo: kikwu kolayi, kayoleho kowu bibi, koza kanani koza kohobu, koshu wonyonya, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />kikpo, kibwu, ipu koko kabo ko Owuso kpiri, ojije ya gege ya yaha ko kpi imu ko Owuso ni yipu ko Okristi Oyesu Adole ka ni lo.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Owuso Kpa Awase nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Nkela ko kwokwoshi nyyi ipu ko Okristi inya kokame lo, otu hin kyogwu mo olemani ipu ko omaku neshi <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Ngbo otu byobya nwashika otu hin ni gbomeyi lo ni. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Nbiya yimu mo ami abiyun abi yumo okwunu shini ebi ko Owuso na kun kpo awayene hin, kipwoma, shini na kaha kpo Okristi. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Awase ki Izrayila. Awayi ko Owuso la, oyuwa wayi nu kweyi shiya wa igyashi nu; shokoyi kpa wa kweyi dowo ono nu; ageyagye do Owuso kwokwoshi; azawo okoyi ko Owuso; <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Awa ayi bwebe kipwoma kawo kyikyi ko Oyahuda; Okristi, ni pya wasuse ni, bwo ema wa. Ahan shiye ko Owuso ni, ya kpogwu koza kpiri ni, ko gbogbo-gbogbo nalemani.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Olema byo ela ko Owuso gbo lalo. Nye kase ni bwipwoma ki Izrayila ni pi wase ko Owuso la lo. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Kweyi, koni abwi ipwoma wani yuwa wayi ki Ibirayi lo. &lt;&lt;Byoni olemani bwebe ki Ishaku pini ayiwo woza.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Ni, olemani omoma kasuse kpiri pi wayi ko Owuso lalo, sa ayi kokoyi pi agye wayi ki Ibirayi kipu nu la. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Olemani koni okoyi kwobonu ka hagye ni; &lt;&lt;Owoni ishi fu nyya kwikye, kweyi Osera ya moyi nongo&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Olemani kin lalo, ayi ko Orabeka epa gbo Ada oye ni wa, ada wa Ishaku osoku ka. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Ni olemani, ome ayapule na ma kwe yoza neshi kwe olabi shini Owuso shu ko ya ni na gbodagye: <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />wa koko lalo oke wa kase ni yuwogwu ni la, aka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Osu ya geyagye do okina nu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Byoni ayita ipu kokpa mo, &lt;&lt;Nyya yimu ko Oyakubu, nke tela ki Isuwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Oji ni aha ba ka? Owuso wino kepwo meme la? Aayi! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Koni okado Omusa, &lt;&lt;Oza ni ase Yani nyya yi gbo koni nyyimu ko yi gbo ni, ome nkiya miyinyinyi kase ni nyya yimu ko miyinyinyi nuni&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Mani oni, ojoji yebe koza ni asuse ba yimu kwoza ni aba ya ni la lo, oke wela kiyinyinyi ko Owuso la. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Koni okpa ko Owuso kado Ofirona mo: &lt;&lt;Nyyo wose ikweyi kela mani, shini na sayi koshu hin bwebe wo, shini ana tono kiye hin ese kpiri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Ni, olemani oni, Owuso ya miyinyinyi kase ni oyimu ko miyinyinyi nu ni, kweyi ase ni oyimu ko yotu gbo, oya yotu gbo.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anya ko Owuso kpo Iyinyinyi nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Oye kala ya kadami mo, &lt;&lt;Ojiya ni Owuso ya baha ela kwikyikyeni ni? Anoho tela koza ni oyayimu koya ni?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Awo wanoho, Asuse, ya shoko kpo Owuso?&gt;&gt; Oza ni oyiyo ni kadanu mo, anoho yo, ojiya ni oyun mani ni?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Ino me eyi gboshu ko yoko kpo ome byoni oya yimu, ko ye eyi oye wako ri imya, oye ke wako yoko shishi kpanu.<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Owoni Owuso, yimu ko kyanya shini ase na gyoshu nu, gbotu mene nwashika, Otu kanya nu, kyanutu ko kyebe? <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Owoni oyoza mani shini awolodu na gyotu ko yigbase nu, ni oya hagye dawase ko kanu ni. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Koni aha ni oyahogwu ni, bwipu kase ko Oyahuda kin lalo, ke bwipu kawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni mamani. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Byoni oka okpa ko Oseya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">&lt;Awase ni wase hin loni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Nyya yuwogwu mase hin;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">ase ni wonya bashi hin lo ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Nyya yogwu mo onya bashi hin.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />&lt;&lt;Ebeni, ogbodagye kweyi Owuso ka dawa mo, &lt;Awase nu lalo,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">ebeni aba yuwogwu ma ayi ko Owuso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Mani oni, Ishaya kela ikweyi ko Izrayila mo; &lt;&lt;Lewa ko Izrayila lema byo isisagye ki ishu ni, awase ni shishini kin pi ba gbo olayi la; <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Koni Adole yawa gbese ogo agye papa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Byoni Ishaya kwobonu ka ikabe ni; &lt;&lt;Owoni Adole Owuso bi shayi bita daha lo, abi ba lema byo Osodom kpo Ogomora.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ase ki Izrayila kpo Oshu Neshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Ojini aba ka? Mo awase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni, labo ko neshi koni pye, oneshi ni wako tata ni; <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Awo ase ki Izrayila ni labo kono ko neshi ni, apye lo, <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Ojiya ni apye lo? Ela koni alabo kpotuse lo, aba ma byo oyebe koza yoya wa la. Mani oni ashikawu ikweyi ki &lt;&lt;ikyikpo ko yase shikawu&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />byoni ayita ipu ko kpa ko Owuso ni mo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">&lt;&lt;Ma, ikyikpo ko Osiyona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">ni yase ba shikawu ni kpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">okpo ni yase ba gboni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Ni olemani, ase ni ke yotuso oya yiweyi lo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Ayene hin, otu hin yimu ko bo Owuso do Izrayila shini na ngmawa. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Omanu ya kolobene ikweyi wa mo agbotu ko gboso Owuso, otuwa ni agbo ni ke wa koza gyogye la lo. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Koni agyoneshi ni wako Owuso lo ni, ayimu koneshi kiyiwa, atawa ko yiyiwa do oneshi ko Owuso. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Okristi pini wokweyi ko ono la, shini oneshi na wa kase ni gbo okwokwoshi shini ana wase neshi kpo Owuso.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ongmongma Wa Kase Kpiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Omusa tenena ikweyi ko omani mo, oneshi ni wako Ono ni: &lt;&lt;Ase ni gboso Ono ni oya gbolayi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Oji no okpa ko Owuso ke ka ikweyi ko neshi ni wokwokwoshi ni mo: &lt;&lt;Ka kamo, anoho ya giso?&gt;&gt; (Shini ana kwikye Okristi wokpagye) <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />kwe anoho ya sa gagye kawa aleku? (Kweyi ana byo Okristi giso shi ikwu). <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Oji ni okpa ko Owuso ka? &lt;&lt;Ela yo pee kpala, oyo kwunu wa kpotu wa.&gt;&gt; Omani, wela kotuse pini aba kala. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Mo, &lt;&lt;Owoni oshagbotu, Oyesu wa Adole,&gt;&gt; kweyi gbo okwokwoshi otuwa mo, Owuso yo nyiso ikwu, aba ngmawa. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Bwipu kotu wa pini aba gbo okwokwoshi la kweyi aya neshi kpotu oye kponu kweyi ashagbotu pini angma wa la. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Byoni okpa ko Owuso kani, &lt;&lt;Ase ni yotuso Owuso aba tiweyi lo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Ikweyi koni Ojije gogo ebe ko Ase ko Oyahuda kpase ni wo Ase ko Oyahuda lo ni lo Ananu pini wa Adole ni wa Adole kase kpiri ni dase odu ni yiye nu ogwu ni, <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Byoni okpa kani, &lt;&lt;Ase ni shogwu yiye ka Adole kotabo, oya ngmanu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Oke ya lemoji, ome, ni aba yiye nu ogwu ni akyogwu kpa nu lo ni? Okiya lemoji ni aba kyogwu kpase ni apwelanu lo ni? Aki ba pwo moji owoni akela ko Owuso dawa lo? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Aba kela ko Owuso moji, owoni otuwoleho lo? Byoni okpa ko Owuso kani, &lt;&lt;Ikpo kawase ni byoshu neshi wani shoshi moji!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />kpiri ko Ase ki Izrayila pini ke zela neshi ko Okristi lalo. Koni Ishaya inobane kamo, &lt;&lt;Adole, anoho kyogwu kpela ka?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Mamani otuse bwebe kela pwopwo la, kweyi ela pwopwo bwebe kela ko Okristi la, <verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Odoka mo Apwolola? Olemani apwo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">&lt;&lt;Oleho wa gebebenya kpiri ese mani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">Oleho wa go okweyi kese mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Nki doka mo, &lt;&lt;Ase ki Izrayila gye lola? Omusa wa kikyikyo ni, kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">&lt;&lt;Nyya yoko kpawase ni wojije lo ni koni ala ba yafu wani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">Nyya yala ba yanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">kweyi ko okpagye ni gyojije lo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Kweyi Ishaya inobane kela kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">&lt;&lt;Ase ni labo hin lo ni pyun;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">Nyyiyun shiyase ni doka hin lo ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Ikweyi koni Ase ki Izrayila kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">&lt;&lt;Ishi kpiri nyyabo hin nata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">dawase niba pwaha lo ni kpawase ni lagbiti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Owuso Miyinyinyi ki Ase ki Izrayila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Nke doka mo: Owuso tela kase nu? Olemani lo! In wo Ase ki Izrayila abiyun, ipwoma ki Ibirayi, bwipwoma ko Obenjami. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Owuso tela kase nu lo, ni ogyuwa ni. Ala gyoza ni ela ko Owuso kani lo, ishini shu ga ni, ela koziyi ko Iliya obo Owuso ela ko Ase ki Izrayila: <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />Adole, ayawo bane wo ngmo kweyi yo okpe kebe ko bo Owuso bya: Anu fufunu pi shishini la, kweyi aba yimu ko yun ngmo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Oji wo kyogwu ko Owuso danu? &lt;&lt;Nyya ase Okpakwu ahapa diyun ni tawa ko geyagye okinafu wa do Obaal ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Ni, olemani, ishi mani ashini kase ke shu bwe ebe ko neshi nu. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Owoni oshoshu nu bwebe ko neshi, owa koko ni aya lalo. Owoni oshoshu ko Owuso biwa koza ni ase ya lalo, mani oni oneshi biya wo neshi kotata lo.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Oji mani? Oji ni ase ki Izrayila labo sheyi gagye kweyi apyelo, awase ni ashuwa ni pye. Ashini pwogwu ko Owuso lo, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />byo ni okpa ka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">&lt;&lt;Owuso dawo omaku ko yalo, agbiyi ake ba ma lo kpa akpaha ake ba pwo lo kwikyikyeni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Kweyi Odawuda kamo, Ozarore kpikpo wa nawo efa ni ya yuwa gbo kyi ya yuwa ba mowe ikweyi ko zakpaha wa. <verse eid="ROM 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Omiyi wa na dibu shini ana ka mebe lo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">kweyi ogbayi wa na wowe gbogbo-gbogbo otuwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Ebeni nke doka: Ashikawu shini ana gbo wako nyiso kelo? Olemani lalo! Ikweyi koni ayozalabi ni, angmawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni shini otu kase ki Izrayila na bya. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Owoni ozalabi kase ko Oyahuda bi wo odu kese mani, kweyi oleha komaku wodu dawase ni wo Ase ko Oyahuda lo ni, odu bi ya sheyi gagye dawa owoni kpiri wa bi lemani!<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ongmogma Kawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Oya kela kpawase ni wo Ase ko Oyahuda lo ni: Byoni owino tono kela ko Owuso dawase ni wo Ase ko Oyahuda lo ni, oyoko neshi kpebe koyoko nu ko tono kela ko Owuso. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Otusose nu wako mamo alemoji shini igyashi kase nu na yanya shini na ngmawase ashini wa. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Owoni otela wa wo nyonye kese kpiri, onyonye wa biya wolayi dawase ni gekwu ni. <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Owoni ofofa kikyoga ni aze kikyikyo wa ko Owuso, oshini kikyoga kpiri wa kakanu mamani, owoni ogba wa ko Owuso, ayabo wa kakanu mamani.<verse eid="ROM 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Owoni ayabo shini kyigbo, kweyi ala, byoni ogwogwa kefu gye nyakwu ni, akpuwa gbayi ipu kawoshishini kweyi ko ogwogwa kogba kefu mani, <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Ala ka gwabotu mala sha ashishini kayabo ni lo. Owoni ala ya mani, ala gbera; ala pini ba dogba oshu lalo, ogba pini ya daloshu la. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Ala ba kamo, &lt;&lt;Ayabo kefu kigbo shini na pyowe ko kpuwa gbayi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Omani wo kwokwoshi. Apa kowa ela koni agbo okwokwoshi lo ni, ni olemani ohagye okwokwoshi. Ka ziyo mo ogyoza shashishe lo, ke wino yoshi.<verse eid="ROM 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Owoni Owuso sha ayabo kokwokwoshi bita lo, ala ba ma byo oya shalabita la?.<verse eid="ROM 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Ala miyinyinyi kpo olono ko Owuso: olono dawase ni gbo ni, oke ya miyinyinyi kala, owoni ala gohobu ipu kiyinyinyi nu. Owoni ala ke ya ma lo, oya yala gwo shonu mamani. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Owoni awoyahuda go ohobu kpo Ogbo kwokwoshi wa lo, oya kpuwa gbayi, Owuso ya gboshu ko ki kpuwa gbayi. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Itikpi komani kpiri, owoni oyala ngma shogwogwa kefu ni gye sheyi gagye abiyinu ni, kweyi tanu kpogwogwa kefu ni gye abiyiwa ni kweyi okpuwa gbayi kpefu ni anyi ni, oya kiyinu fu moji, ni ayabo ke efu ni gye abiyinu, okpuwa gbayi kpo efu.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Owuso Miyinyinyi Kase Kpiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Oya yimu shini anaka wase ni gyo oza ni ya gbodagye lo ni koza ni agye lo, ayene shini anaka wino gye shoshu lo: Ase ki Izrayila ke mowe gbishini ewa kawase ni wo ase ko Oyahuda lo ni kwikye wipu. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Ni olemani, kpiri kawa Ase ki Izrayila aba ngma awa, byo ni akwobonu tani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">&lt;&lt;Ino ngmase yawa bwo Osiyona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">Oya yawase ni tela ko gboso Owuso ni ngma shi ipwoma ko Oyakubu.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Kweyi omani pi wokoyi nu kpawa la</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">owoni oyozalabi wa yi bize.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Byoni oshu neshi ko Oyesu kani, awino tela kala; byoni ela koshoshu weni, aba woya ikweyi kawo kyikyi wa. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Owuso ya gege ya yotu nu pya ikweyi kase ni oshu ni lo. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Byoni awani wase ko Oyahuda lo ni, ishi oye atawa ko gboso ono ko Owuso ni, anana mani ala ke kyogwu kpo oneshi ko Owuso ikweyi koni ase ko yahuda tela ko gboso ono ko Owuso. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Ni, olemani awa mamani anana mani tela ko gboso ono ko Owuso shini awa mamani Owuso na yigbuwa ela kiyinyinyi ko Owuso. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Koni Owuso wobi kase kpiri ni tela ko gboso ono nu ni ela koni oya yigbuwa kpiri ni.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sho Owuso Iye</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Odu ko Owuso gyokwu moji! Oziyi kpogyogye nu libwu kotata!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">Anoho ya gege ya gyoza ni otu nu ze ni? Anoho ya gyowe nu?<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />&lt;&lt;Anoho gyotu ko Owuso?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Kwe anoho wino danela?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />&lt;&lt;Anoho do Owuso oza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">shini Owuso na sore?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Ikweyi koni kpiri aya bwebe nu, kweyi kpiri mani wa bwebe nu danu. Igyashi wa ko Owuso ko gbogbo-gbogbo! Nalemani.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Oyagye ko Yoko do Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Ni, olemani oni, ayene, nyya bala eshi kiyinyinyi ko Owuso ine ko olayi, ala ziyikala do Owuso, na weshi ni kwiyi, ni wosere, ni ya sho Owuso otu ni. Omani pi wo geyagye kokwokwoshi la. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Ala ka gbosowe koza yoya kese mani lo, otu kala ke na pyabo bwebe ko kyotu kala pya wopepe. Ebeni ala ba gege ko gyoza ni otu ko Owuso we ni, imu kotu nu ni wo neneshi ni ki gyogya ni.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Bwebe keshi ni Owuso dami ni nyya ka da ananoho kala mo: ka ziyo mo woje sheyi gagye lo. Abishi koni, ziyo gyogye kpoza ni owe ni, kweyi miyoma bwebe kotuse ni Owuso dawo ni. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Byoni kpiri wa wikpiye oye kponu ni kpase shishini nwashika, kweyi awase shishini mani, oko wa woye kponu lalo, <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Ni olemani, ipu ko Okristi, awani nwashika bwikpiye oye kponu ni, kweyi ananoho kase mani wakawase shishini kpiri la. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Abola gogo-gogo, bwebe keshi ni odawa ni. Owoni eshi kashe wako bane, na yoko kpanu kpotuse byoni ogbo ni, <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Owoni owa ko yoko, na yoko kpanu owoni owa ko foza, na foza; <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Owoni owa ko totugbagba, na totugbagba, owoni owa ko tase ni gbo lo abo, na dawa kpotu oye kponu, owoni owa ko woteyi, na yoteyi neshi owoni owa ko yoneshi, na ya neshi.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">IMU</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Imu na wako tata. Tela koza ni wo bibi ni, yabo byoza ni wo neshi ni, <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Ala yimu kiyikala neshi byoni ala wayine ni, ananoho na moyinanu gyiyi shiyinu. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Ala ka nye ipu koko lo, omaku kala ke na loshu ko yoko do Owuso. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Iyitagye wa nawo otunehe, ana gbotumene ipu kebi ni aba dawani, ana tinarigwu ipu gishi kpiri. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Ala koza ni ala gbo ni kpayene kala kipu ko Okristi ni gbo lo ni, kweyi ala gwofunu kole kala dawogboga.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Bo Owuso na yabo neshi sawase ni ba daha owe ni, ana kela neshi, ana ka suwesa lo. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Shotunehe kpa awase ni ba shotunehe ni, byotu kpawase niba byotu ni. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Ala bagye neshi kpiyikala. Ala ka zikweyi iso lo, ala ke yoko ni gbo gwakya lo ni. Ala ka miyi kala mala ziyi lo.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Ala ka sashishe ore kobibi kpobibi lo. Ana gbera ko yoza neshi iyi kananoho. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Obiya woza, owe ebewala, ana yagye neshi kpa ananoho. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Ana ka sore lo, awoya hin moshi, ana ke shibita do Owuso na sore, koni okpa ko Owuso kamo, &lt;&lt;Adole kamo, Owa kakahin ko sore la: nyya sore.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />kweyi okpa ko Owuso kamo: &lt;&lt;Owoni omonyekwotu wo ya ngmemye, danoza na re: Owoni igini ya ngmo, daninyi na gwa. Owoni oya mani, oya yeha kola sikweyi oma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Alaka kyogwu obibi na kpala gwalagye lo, ala ke kpefu kpo obibi kpo neshi.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Geyagye da Wayikoko ko Oyesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Ananoho na geyagye dawoteyi ni ba kpogwu kase ni, koni igabo kpiri woyoya ko Owuso la, kweyi awase ni boka ni, Owuso pini shuwa la. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Ni, olemani oni, ase ni tanu ko zela kayikoko ko Oyesu oya tanu koza ni Owuso shu ni pi yoma, mani oni, awase ni ya mani ba byepwo wikweyi wa pi yoma. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Koni awase ni ba yo neshi ba yoshi kayikoko ko Oyesu lo, sawase niba yobibi ni ke ba yoshi. Oya yimu ko kabo kposhi kase ni wigabo kokpagye ni? Yoza ni shoshi ni, kweyi aba koneshi wo. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Koni owoyole ko Owuso ni yoko ko yuwo neshi. Owoni oyobibi, oya yoshi nu, ikweyi koni ogboshu ko gbogo agye. Owoyole ko Owuso, niya byanya ko Owuso wa dase ni ba yozalabi ni. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Mani oni, owotiri ko geyagye dayikoko ko Oyesu, owotiri ko gbogo agye lalo, oke wa ko shawo oneshi kpo olabi. <verse eid="ROM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Oza ni ya ni ala ba zegba ni oma, koni awigabo wayole ko Owuso la, ko yoko wa gyogye. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Sananoho ore koza ni okpawo ni: sore kegba kiyo kpiyo wo, kweyi mananoho gyiyi.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oko ko Ya Diyikala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Ka shore kojije bita ikweyi wo lo, na wore ko yimu kiyikala fufunu. Ase ya yimu ko oyinanu oya geyagye dono pi yoma. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Ono pi yoma, &lt;&lt;Ana ka beba lo,&gt;&gt; kpo ono shishini ni yaba ni, woye kponu kpo omani la: &lt;&lt;Yimu koyene wo byoni oya yimu kiyo ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Owoni ogbimu kase, oya yuwofo lo, oke ya yuwo bibi lo, ko yimu ke wo geyagye dono la.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Owotiri koyo mani, Wogyogye konabani. Ishi yawa koni aya shiyi ola wa, koni ongmawa yo pye shishi ni, agbo otata ni. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Otu shishini gbayayi ko kweyi; ebe ya nya wa. Ni, olemani ana yoko kebe dibu tokoka shini ana shoshiye kebe yoyu. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Ahan byiyikaha neshi, byawase ni boyoyu keno ni, wo owu yoya kpinyi gwogwa lalo, wa keba boba lalo kpa ari tututu, wa kotu byobya kpo anya lalo. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Mani oni, ziyo koko ka Adole Oyesu Okristi, ka yela kawoza ni wimu kikpiye ni lo na gbuwa, kweyi anaka gbimu koza kese yeye mani lo.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Ka Kwase Ashini Epwo lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />kyogwu kpawase ni otuse wa loshu lo ni, wa koni aya kepwo ikweyi kela ni ashoko ni lalo. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Otuse kashe kyogwu danu ko hoza kpiri, ashe ke, otuse nu loshu lo, oya ho epwu kin la <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Ase ni ya hoza kpiri ni naka tase ni yaha lo ni nye lo, ase ni ke ya hoza kpiri lo naka kwase ni yahoza kpiri ni epwo lo, ikweyi koni Owuso kyogwu kpanu. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Owanoho ko kepwo ikweyi koshe kashe? Adole nu pini gboshu ko yo hagye kwo ona gbo la. Oke ya hagye, Ikweyi koni Adole agege koyo hagye.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Ashe oye meno oye wosere sheno oye hoha; Ashe oye meno nye woye kponu. Ananoho na kyogwu ipu kotu nu. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Ase ni meno oye shoshi, yamani ko da Adole abokpa. Ase ni hebe, naha da Adole, koni oshotunehe do Owuso ni, mamani, ase ni tanu yamani da Adole kweyi shotunehe do Owuso. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Koni ashishe ka yabo kiyinu lalo, aha ke gekwu diyika fufu ka la lo. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Owoni agbo layi, agbo layi do Adole; kwe owoni agekwu, agekwu do Adole ni olemani, owoni agekwu kwe agbo olayi, awa ka Adole la.<verse eid="ROM 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Ikweyi kela mani, Okristi gekwu kweyi ki gbo layi shini na wa Adole kawase ni gekwu kpawo gbo olayi. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Ala ke, Ojiya ni ala ba kwayene kala epwo? Kwe ala ni ba hojoji ni, ojiya ni ala ba mawo gboso shishini wojije lo? Kpiri kaha ba wa hagye obutu ko Owuso shini ona kwahepwo. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Ikweyi ko ni okpa ko Owuso kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">&lt;&lt;Adole kamo, byoni nyyiyi kwokwoshi ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">kpiri kokinafu ba kwagye obutu hin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">kpiri kigbenu ba kamo nwwo Owuso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Mani oni ananoho ya koza ni oya ni do Owuso.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaya Ashe Nagbo Lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Mani oni, ala ka kwiyikala epwo lo. Abishi koni ala takirikwu shini ala ka wikyikpo ko shikawu kwe oza ni ya yase shishini kwikye itikpi ni lo. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Byase oye ni yo dudu kya Adole Oyesu ni, Omanu gye kwokwoshi mo, ona oyoye wosere abi yimu lo. Owoni ashe zoje winyi, ebe nu owinyi. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Owoni oyotu kashe bya ikweyi koza ni oha ni, oke ya shiya nu imu kelo. Ka yoyeneho ni Okristi gekwu ikweyi nu ni yishi ikweyi koza ni oha nilo. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Ka shibita anako bibi ikweyi koza ni oze wo neshi nilo. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Koni obula ko Owuso, wako roza kpinyi gwogwa lalo, oke wo gyogye, oyagye neshi, kpotu nehe ipu ko omaku sere. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Kpiri kase ni gboso Okristi owe mani, Owuso ya shotunehe kpa nu kweyi ase ba kyogwu kpa nu.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Ni olemani, ahan takirikwu koyoza ni ya byoyagye neshi wani kpo otabo ko diyika oshu. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Ahan ka yoko ko Owuso yishi ela kozarore lo. Kpiri kozarore shoshi ko rore, oke shoshi ko hoza ni ya wowe kigbo kashe ni lo. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Oya shoshi oka hebe lo kwe gwinyi lo kwe ko yoje ni ya yo oyene wo agboni.<verse eid="ROM 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Mani oni, kpiri koza ni oyotuso nawo obepa wo kpo Owuso. Otunehe wa kase ni ya yiyinu ishi lo ikweyi koza ni okyogwu kpanu ni! <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Ase ni ke kyogwu lo, oyishi owoni ohoza, koni ozahoha nu wa kotuse lalo; kpo kpiri koza ni bwo otuse lalo wozalabi.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Mase Shishini Shiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Aha ni loshu ipu kotuse ni shu ko zo enu kawase ni loshu lo ni. Wako yimu kiyika la lo. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Ananoho kaha na yoza neshi ni ya yotu koya koyagye nu ya kagye ni, shini otuse wa na gye. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Kwo Okristi yoneshi diyinu kin la lo, byo ni okpa kamo, &lt;&lt;Esa ni aso ni wa gbo ikweyi hin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Oza ni ata ipu kokpa kpiri ni ata koni aba faha, shini an gbiyitagye bwebe ko zotu kpo otugbagba ni okpa daha ni.<verse eid="ROM 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Owuso ni wotu kotumene kpo otugbagba ni na dala omaku kikweyi gbayi obepa kala niba gboso Okristi Oyesu ni, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />Koni ipu kotu kpo okwunu oye kponu ala ba shotunehe do Owuso ni wa Ada ka Adole ka Oyesu Okristi ni.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oshu Neshi Dawase ni wase ko Oyahuda Loni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />kyogwu kpananoho ipu kigyashi ko Owuso, byoni Okristi kyogwu kpala ni, shini ana shotunehe do Owuso. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Nkadala mo Okristi wo oyoleho kawase ko Oyahuda okwunu ko otuse ko Owuso, ko yokoyi ni oshe da awokyikyi wani nawo kwokwoshi. <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />Shini awase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni na shotunehe do Owuso ine kiyinyinyi, byoni okpa ko owuso kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">&lt;&lt;Ni olemani nyya shawo iye obepa kawase ni wo Ase ko Oyahuda lo ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">nyya wigye diyewa. <verse eid="ROM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Oki kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">shotunehe, Awase ni wase ko yahuda lo ni, kpawase ko Owuso!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Kweyi oki kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">Kpiri kawase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni, ana sho Adole iye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">ase kese kpiri na shaniye.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Ishaya ki kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">Ema ko Ojesi ya bwu wese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">oye ni yawa kpogwu kawase kawo kpagye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">awase niwo ase ko Oyahuda lo ni ba yiyitagye danu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Owuso kiyitagye na yala nwonwu kpo otunehe kpo otumene, ni ala yotuso ni, koni iyitagye kala asheyi gagye bwebe koshu ko Omaku Sere.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ozani yo Obulus Tokpa Kpo Oshi lo ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Ayene hin: Ami abiyun gye mo oshoshi shini ala gyoza ni ala shu koya ni neneshi, shini ala gege ko fiyikala oza. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Nyya tawoza mani dala kpoko nyakwu ikweyi koneshi koni Owuso dami ni <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />Ko wo oshe ko Oyesu Okristi shini na kela ko Owuso dawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni. Nyya yoko byo Osapa ko tono koshu neshi ko Oyesu shini awase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni, na weshi ni Owuso ya kyogwu kpanu ni, Omaku Sere ko Owuso kyanutu ni.<verse eid="ROM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Ikweyi koni nyyo dudu kpo Okristi ni, nyya gwabotu ipu koko hin ni nyya ya do Owuso ni. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Nyya kela ni Okristi mo naka ni kpoko nyakwu shini awase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni na geyagye do Owuso. Bwebe koza ni nyya ka kweyi yaya <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />bwebe koshu koyi kpawoza kigbashi ni Omaku ko Owuso ya neneshi ni. Bwebe komani, nko Oshu Neshi ko Okristi bwo Ojerusele gbishini nggo Ilirikum. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Ngbimu ko tono koshu neshi ko Okristi gebe ni apwela nu lo ni, shini naka kela ikweyi koza ni ashe ka hagye lo ni. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Byoni Okpa ko Owuso kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">Awase ni akela nu dawa lo ni ba ma kpiyi wa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">kweyi awase ni pwo lo ni ba gyikweyi nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus gbomu ko gatase ko Oroma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Ozani ya ni ishi nwashika awumobi ko webe kala ni oma.<verse eid="ROM 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Anani ni nke yoko hin ya kweyi agbabo mani kweyi ni nyya yimu kowa mala ishayi nwashika wa ni, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Nyya yimu ko wa anani. Nyya yimu ko mala ishini nyyowe ya ga ko Osupen, shini ala tumabo ko gebe ni, ishini nmonye koyagye kpala kishi gbayayi. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Anani ke nyyowe ko go Ojerusele ipu koko ni nyya da ase ko Owuso ni. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Koni Omakidoniya kpo Akaya zoza kotukyokye kpotu wa oyekponu ko dawoleha ni bipu kase ko Owuso Ojerusele ni. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Aze bwipu kotu wa la, kokwokwoshi ashu ko tuwabo. Koni ase ko Oyahuda yeshi wa komaku ko kpawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni, awase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni shu ko yeshi wa kiyo kese ko kpase ko Oyahuda. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Ishini nyyo ko mani kweyi ni yeshi mani dawa, nyya go Osupen, kweyi nyya bwebe kala. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Ngye mo ishini nbwebe kala, nyya wa kpa aboneshi ko Okristi nwashika.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Ayene hin, nyya bala, ipu kiye ka Adole Oyesu Okristi bwebe kimu ko Omaku, ala takirikwu dudu kpami bwebe ko bo Owuso dami.<verse eid="ROM 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Ala tinarigwu shini Owuso na ngmami shabo kawase ni gyo Owuso lo ni bo Oyahudiya ni, ala ki tinarigwu mase ko Owuso ni bo Ojerusele ni na zoko hin ni nyya ebe wa ni. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Shini na webe kala kpo otunehe shini apyoshu pepe dudu ebe ko Owuso. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Owuso, ine ko omene na yo kpala kpiri. Nalemani.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Ogbogba hin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Ngbela neshi ko kadala ikweyi ko oyene ka Ofibi, ino yoko ipu koda ko Owuso ni yo Osenkiriya ni. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Ala zo ipu kiye ka Adole, byoni ase ko Owuso baya ni, kweyi ala tabo kpoza ni oya doka ebe kala ni; ikweyi koni otase nwashika abo ka mami.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />To Oprisila kpo Akwila ogbogba dami, awoya koko hin ipu koko ko Okristi Oyesu. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Ayo olayi wa kwabo ikweyin. Ami fufun pi ya shotunehe dawa lalo, koda ko Owuso kpiri ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Ki tase ko Owuso ni ba gbayi ole wa ni ogbogba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Toya hin ke Epenetus ogbogba, anu ni wa kikyikyo ko totuso Okristi okpagye ko Asiya ni. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />To Omeremu ogbogba, anu ni ya yoko kotata dala ni. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Ta Andronikus kpo Ojuniya ogbogba, ase ko Oyahuda ka ni bo oruduru kpami ishi oye ni; agyuwa neneshi ipu kayole ko Oyesu, kweyi azo Oyesu kwobonu dami.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Nki ya ta Ampilatus ogbogba, oya hin moshi ipu kema ka Adole. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />To Obanus ogbogba, oya koko ka ipu koko ko Okristi, ki toya hin moshi ko Ostakis ogbogba dami. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Ta Apeles ogbogba, anu ni amoma kweyi tanu ya geyagye gyogye ipu ko Okristi ni. Tase kole ka Aristobulus ogbogba dami. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />To Oherodiyo ni wase ko Oyahuda ka ni ogbogba, kpase kipwoma ko Onakisus ni bipu ka Adole.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />To Otrafina kpo Otrafosa ogbogba, anya mani yoko kotata ipu ka Adole. Ki toya hin moshi ko Opasis ni yoko nwashika da Adole ni ogbogba. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />To Orufus ogbogba, anu ni ashu ipu ka Adole ni, kpinanu ni ki wene dami ni. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Ta Asinkritus ogbogba, kpo Oflegon, kpo Ohames, kpo Opatrobas, kpo Ohamas kpayene ashini ni baba kpawa ni. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />To Ofilologos kpo Ojuliya ogbogba, ki to Oneriyos kpo oyinanu nonya ogbogba, kpo Olipasi kpase ko Owuso kpiri.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Ala tiyikala ogbogba kweyi kwiyikala botu ipu ko neshi ko Okristi. Awoda ko Owuso kpiri mo na talogbogba.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akpaha Pyopyi Ko gwejeji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Nyya bala, ayene hin, ala gbera kpawino yikweyi kase ko kweyi ki ba yoza sowe ko yase shikawu showe koza ni ala fu ni bita. Ala gwowe wa tagye. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Koni awase ni ba yoza mani ba yoko da Adole Okristi lalo, aba ya ela kipu wa la. Bwebe kokwunu lonye wa kpo shase iye kokame aba gyawase ni gyozalabi lo ni egya. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Ananoho pwela kogeyagye kala, mani oni nshotunehe kotata ikweyi kala; nke ya yimu shini ala ziyi ikweyi koza ni woza neshi ni, kweyi wase ni gyojije lo ikweyi kozalabi. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Owuso ine komene ya yi Ibiri da eye kikpo kala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Oneshi ka Adole ka Oyesu na yo kpala.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Otimoti, oya koko hin ya talogbogba; mamani Olusiyos, kpo Ojason, kpo Ososipata, awa ni wase ko Oyahuda kpami dudu ni.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Ami Otatiyos ni abo hin tokpa mani, ya talogbogba ipu ka Adole.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Ogayos ni ami yole nu, ase ko Owuso kpiri ki ba gbayi ole nu ni ya talogbogba, Erastos ino byolashiko ko ogya, kpoyene ka ko Okwatus ba talogbogba. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Adole Oyesu Okristi na sala aboneshi kpiri kala. Nalemani!<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogwejeji Kinarigwu Kotunehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />An sho Owuso iye! Anu ni gege ko yala hagye giri ipu koshu neshi kpono totu ko Oyesu Okristi ni ntu dala ni, bwebe ko sayi koza ni ayi teba bwawoyi ni shigbo ga nekye-nekye ni. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Anani oke sayi nu kweyi yase gyo ipu kenena kawobane bwebe ko ono ko Owuso ko gbogbo-gbogbo, shini okpagye kpiri na totuso na ki geyagye danu.<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Igyashi wa ko Owuso, anu fufunu ni wine koziyi ni, bwebe ko Oyesu Okristi ko gbogbo-gbogbo! Nalemani.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>